{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_014_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_014_title", "source_sha256": "fb765fe115aa7b7d060d596a3a037cad0defa39c21cdfe6f9a8b87a5926bfb34", "ja": "だって、大好きだから！", "zh": "因为是我的最爱！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_014_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_014_synopsis", "source_sha256": "a3286a20bc2be48382980ce573ef6b0ed56194054653d38eb92a918f88fe4fe6", "ja": "公演に向けてジュリア、志保と共にレッスン\nに励む可奈。可奈がセンターを務めることに\n納得できない志保は、厳しい言葉で可奈の未\n熟さを指摘するが、可奈はむしろ志保に感謝\nしてレッスンを重ね、公演を成功させる。", "zh": "为了公演，可奈和茱莉亚、志保一同专心在\n训练课程上。无法认同可奈担任Center的\n志保严厉指出可奈的不足之处，\n但可奈反而感谢志保，并透过不断的训练，\n让公演圆满成功。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_014_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_014_1000_p", "source_sha256": "848cb1f779817c112154cdf425c1ffa9de2d040f922bc61294e78afe20987642", "ja": "（……よし、舞台監督とPAに渡す書類は\nこんな感じでいいかな）", "zh": "（……好，要给舞台导演和PA的文件\n差不多就这样吧。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_014_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_014_1001_p", "source_sha256": "d10f878795448b20acd99f6ef7fc2127f3a25b8ac3ca8f9b699617fca77e3583", "ja": "（さて、肝心の可奈たちの様子は……）", "zh": "（好了，身为主角的可奈她们现在……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_014_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_014_1002_036kan", "source_sha256": "e809aeaf4b5c3d3d9028937e3be4d019410772c9a2e36b60b4edfdbd77059792", "ja": "ジュリアさん！\n今のターンどうでしたかっ？", "zh": "茱莉亚！\n刚刚那个回旋你觉得怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_014_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_014_1003_050jul", "source_sha256": "ee9985160d0f4f033a9d4655767634f401e63e20e369624deaa8147a4598a51c", "ja": "ああ、完ぺきだ！\nこれで振り付けは、全部覚えたんじゃないか？", "zh": "嗯，非常完美！\n这样就把舞步通通记住了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_014_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_014_1004_036kan", "source_sha256": "fb26fecdc98cae08eb3e26292006e53cac5c703d68c09cd9d2ad0f50bcac78e7", "ja": "えへへ、やった～！　早く本番来ないかな～♪\nセンターで踊る矢吹可奈～♪", "zh": "嘿嘿，太好了～！好希望公演快来喔～♪\n在Center跳舞的矢吹可奈～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_014_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_014_1005_p", "source_sha256": "f306b2ef1724fa381914d460aff1be1b73534c4757074fe025d9381e4b38fdae", "ja": "ふたりとも、お疲れさま。\nどうやら調子いいみたいだな。", "zh": "辛苦你们两位了。\n看起来状况不错嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_014_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_014_1006_036kan", "source_sha256": "8eecfab88210b5d99a74c3bf0d18cab1cfd61adf6e8a2a2351bfd996ecda340f", "ja": "{$P$}さん！\nはいっ。もう振り付けを全部覚えたんですよっ。", "zh": "{$P$}先生！\n没错，我们把舞步都记起来了喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_014_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_014_1007_p", "source_sha256": "d37500c0644a1c78fc44f8eec8b9211b9fc94fd8a20d2f411d4c03eb903bc6f4", "ja": "おっ、すごいじゃないか！", "zh": "喔，很厉害嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_014_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_014_1008_036kan", "source_sha256": "090454ea590215a44a88809cc29dc7a884c3fa1d30a436291543d07f3c7e3f7f", "ja": "えへ♪　あとは歌の特訓だけです！\n楽しみだな～。", "zh": "嘿嘿♪接着只剩唱歌的特训了！\n好期待喔～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_014_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_014_1009_036kan", "source_sha256": "3984f984b459615c36e67ae636fe8d4a941803250095f46069d5e1ddd0c04475", "ja": "とっくん、とっくん、猛特訓～♪\nばっちりたっぷり歌っちゃうぞ、お～♪", "zh": "特训、特训、不停特训～♪\n可奈要唱好唱满唷，喔～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_014_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_014_1010_050jul", "source_sha256": "b96b01aec0700a64e60257d9af9aa2d4654a48459b02f53f9793a298c07cb300", "ja": "ははっ、なんか、\nレッスンが楽しみになってくる歌だな？", "zh": "哈哈！听了这首歌，\n感觉会让人开始期待训练课程呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_014_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_014_1011_033sih", "source_sha256": "86700626e7ef52651b0e377cdec07f8589af5c04cb4572779251d04c51548b06", "ja": "お疲れ様です。\n二人とも……、もう来ていたんですね。", "zh": "辛苦了。\n两位……这么早就到了呀。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_014_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_014_1012_036kan", "source_sha256": "2ad77f01ab6a9d28177a40feb774fe2e06e0b82728c68466f4d084182e05fd5d", "ja": "あ、ボーカルレッスン、志保ちゃんも一緒だよね。\nよろしくね、志保ちゃん！", "zh": "啊，志保也要参加歌唱课呢。\n请多指教了，志保！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_014_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_014_1013_050jul", "source_sha256": "b5cbea15a25241ef69da9d280d4b703cbd678241f14c1e82415d6495ad4cd57a", "ja": "シホ、お互い気合い入れていこうぜ。\nうかうかしてると、可奈に置いていかれるからな！", "zh": "志保，我们一起打气加油吧。\n一直悠悠哉哉的话，可是会被可奈抛下的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_014_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_014_1014_033sih", "source_sha256": "5e4677dc41de2235305e1161a1bf0327bd807f3bfa571c28408975ba4be0646a", "ja": "…………。\nあ、先生、来ましたよ。", "zh": "…………\n啊，老师来了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_014_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_014_1015_036kan", "source_sha256": "fd8bdab38abff4165fdbc34d098522fb635ad5b27729b0d4871021ff0df11ea9", "ja": "ありがとうございました！", "zh": "谢谢老师！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_014_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_014_1016_050jul", "source_sha256": "fd8bdab38abff4165fdbc34d098522fb635ad5b27729b0d4871021ff0df11ea9", "ja": "ありがとうございました！", "zh": "谢谢老师！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_014_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_014_1017_033sih", "source_sha256": "cded9e5bb89981c91f6644e1c616cfb2b4a06fc6ad35fea350649630ad597bd9", "ja": "ありがとうございました。", "zh": "谢谢指导。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_014_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_014_1018_050jul", "source_sha256": "60b9596b93695c20d52729afdf66f0d34258f93e20496abb5b0a4236156a14f6", "ja": "ふぅ～……。\nさすがに一時間みっちりは、ハードだな……。", "zh": "呼～\n整整一小时的课程，真的挺累人的呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_014_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_014_1019_036kan", "source_sha256": "14457ced4d62a2a0ad51e0e799fcf51a6b01e491c724934ef1d57c657443accb", "ja": "歌のレッスン～♪　大成功～♪\n来週までの～宿題もいっぱい～♪", "zh": "歌唱课～♪圆满成功～♪\n下周上课前的～作业也好多～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_014_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_014_1020_033sih", "source_sha256": "e8ebf282f446af6c527e02531a49b72ea1a84de49bbae8e0707ed7da97d239ec", "ja": "大成功……？", "zh": "圆满成功……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_014_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_014_1021_050jul", "source_sha256": "503f92f7096fe469829c7841c9aed9d665125ee6d87fefc567214e0184dd20cf", "ja": "って、まだ歌いたりないのか。こってり\n絞られたってのに、可奈はホント元気だな！", "zh": "哇，你还唱不够啊。\n老师都严厉成那样了，可奈真有活力耶！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_014_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_014_1022_036kan", "source_sha256": "b62b0afb6a9071738e9f63aa9f6849fb808a009ce9de9c58be0ad5ef872e9e30", "ja": "はい！　たくさん怒られちゃいましたけど、\nそのぶん、上手になれたかな～って。", "zh": "是啊！虽然一直被骂，\n但被骂得多，我想进步得也会多吧～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_014_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_014_1023_036kan", "source_sha256": "de29799ac0537a22ec2796e62318e8aa984cc042bd66aaa46c77e886ecb8e24c", "ja": "{$P$}さん、どうですか？\n少しは千早さんみたいに、上手く歌えそうですか？", "zh": "{$P$}先生，你觉得呢？\n我有办法唱得像千早一样好吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_014_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_014_1024_p", "source_sha256": "8dca6385f8accc48e351ecdfdeedcd114040d3fc8a4efc56ab432379ad4af890", "ja": "はは、そうだな。少なくとも、練習量なら千早に\n負けてないぞ。だから、いつかきっと上手くなる。", "zh": "哈哈，这个嘛，至少你现在的练习量\n没有输给千早喔。总有一天一定会进步的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_014_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_014_1025_036kan", "source_sha256": "07c99a0abc1dac91643edfe1e1bf149f55a5a8e391f40bf1a0a45110c7fa84a0", "ja": "本当ですか！？　わぁい！\nいつか～、千早さんと一緒に、ライブしたいな～♪", "zh": "真的吗！？耶！\n希望有朝一日，能和千早一起举办演唱会～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_014_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_014_1027_033sih", "source_sha256": "2d86df2bc74e52351db30d4a550f3e06ff549e1b34a0e96d7ba1986d99aadb77", "ja": "どうして誰もはっきり言わないんですか？", "zh": "为什么都没人愿意讲明白？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_014_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_014_1028_036kan", "source_sha256": "698bceb8b2cde22b3e18c7997b79111a01188443db7d58daa8772fe9dfeca06c", "ja": "え？", "zh": "咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_014_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_014_1029_050jul", "source_sha256": "cec72715d9bdcdb570cb853ef292ed380c14aeac553ed4cec30800161e9a71a0", "ja": "シホ……？", "zh": "志保……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_014_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_014_1030_033sih", "source_sha256": "ccd93e2f914d292ad1467272246170db7458adcda8934ff10266a20422b1a128", "ja": "矢吹さん。あなたの歌は、ほとんど音程が合って\nないわ。ただ元気がいいだけで、リズムもバラバラ。", "zh": "矢吹，你唱歌根本没一个音是对的。\n空有活力，却连拍子都对不准。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_014_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_014_1031_033sih", "source_sha256": "e25707e70cad6e848ebce10bedbde353b93d66968e897179466df1751cd56db3", "ja": "今のままじゃ、センターなんて務まらないと思う。\n千早さんとは、比べる以前の問題じゃないかしら。", "zh": "我不认为你这样下去能担任Center。\n更不用说要跟千早比较了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_014_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_014_1032_050jul", "source_sha256": "130f1ef81609a2f1a447d89df58320f490c104bcd5df2d78742602fb6bdcae85", "ja": "お、おい、シホ！", "zh": "喂、喂，志保！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_014_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_014_1033_036kan", "source_sha256": "8b24a4e6890a762d3665520cfe031d991f545c9a3a9fd75324482b99c89cc18f", "ja": "も、もちろん、千早さんみたいに、\n歌えるはずないけど……。", "zh": "我、我当然，\n也没妄想说能唱得像千早那么棒……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_014_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_014_1034_036kan", "source_sha256": "cbb805e3e4b41165fdb9d562df91e561cc173517d02c07f40b29f4ddb42e9d45", "ja": "そ……そっか～。\n私、そんなにダメだったんだ～。", "zh": "原……原来～\n我唱得这么糟呀～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_014_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_014_1035_036kan", "source_sha256": "6ee12e8540ed81daaab9c8c5370a75d8d5fb73fdc82dd2b962f3b0852501e91f", "ja": "えへへ、ごめんなさい。\nちょっと外で休憩してきますね。", "zh": "嘿嘿，真对不起大家。\n我去外面休息一下唷。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_014_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_014_1036_p", "source_sha256": "9e4704ea65337c3997f0a63b8c0b1591e1e8e32dd91eae7de9759c4933e04177", "ja": "可奈……。", "zh": "可奈……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_014_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_014_1037_050jul", "source_sha256": "a36d28a136b8dd63f03438fb6486558ff4576465dd6d06b20d18ae48420a9c52", "ja": "シホ。なんだって、あんなこと言ったんだ？", "zh": "志保，你为什么要说那种话？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_014_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_014_1038_033sih", "source_sha256": "d4648ea5a10e14676079410f1fb49fa1b9db450d32804fd8e5356b8d04d8db1e", "ja": "なんでって……。今のままじゃ全然ダメってことが、\n矢吹さんには伝わってないみたいでしたから。", "zh": "还问我为什么……因为我看矢吹根本就不明白，\n自己这样下去根本上不了台面。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_014_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_014_1039_033sih", "source_sha256": "bba89e0fb5f20bac885aea0bd702d03e07be602a0c31ec869e09d26606463da4", "ja": "ハッキリ言わないのは、\n本人のためにもならないと思いますけど。", "zh": "我可不认为隐瞒真相\n会对她有什么帮助。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_014_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_014_1040_050jul", "source_sha256": "14e0e02ae227124f0bf7d09e1a7303c191d657b3234d1d08922b4e86fcfc28e4", "ja": "いや、それにしたってさ。\nもう少し言い方ってものがあるだろ？", "zh": "话虽这么说，\n但你也能讲得再婉转一些吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_014_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_014_1041_050jul", "source_sha256": "a79c1434ca93495475022f5c4b3ed9e5bbc2e6f6cdaf1e3cb636cf5827d972aa", "ja": "それに……あたしは好きだよ、可奈の歌。\nたしかに、音程もリズムもまだまだだけどさ。", "zh": "而且……我很喜欢可奈唱的歌。\n虽然就如你说的，她的音准跟拍子都还有待加强……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_014_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_014_1042_050jul", "source_sha256": "f94b0af82833b1507ffe0a5bd71ba75708c862371f43d2f6709aa37831ee9de9", "ja": "でも、耳に残る。……いや、歌ってる可奈が、\n心に残る。そんな歌だと思うんだ。", "zh": "可是，令人难以忘怀……应该说，可奈唱歌的样子\n会打动人心。我觉得她唱歌就是有这样的魅力。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_014_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_014_1044_033sih", "source_sha256": "72c3ca0edd4a0c96b4daf57f628bb836129c00259126959c664a720ce35f7390", "ja": "だからって、今のままステージに出たら、\n矢吹さん自身が一番困るんじゃないですか。", "zh": "就算你说得没错，但就这样直接登台，\n我看到时候最头疼的人就是矢吹自己吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_014_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_014_1045_050jul", "source_sha256": "9dd0b9e7ba9e478fa9713584834e5cca71d94bb85d4692f762b3e4d8629746d9", "ja": "はは、そりゃまあそうだな！\nでもさ、あれだけ前向きなんだ。なんとかなるって♪", "zh": "哈哈，这么说也对！\n不过呀，她那么乐观积极，肯定不用我们担心啦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_014_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_014_1046_033sih", "source_sha256": "7e83d41fc2327200838fc29097d2e1cb35e5e88b15b07809b90515cea42607ba", "ja": "前向きなのはいいですけど。\n前に進めてないことは、ちゃんと……。", "zh": "态度乐观积极是很好，\n但她本身没有进步，要跟她说清楚才……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_014_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_014_1047_p", "source_sha256": "19f262ddc35fdc30dd03a5c3edcc35d50fe1d48e4fcb655f09c55f1380ffb32b", "ja": "つまり、志保も可奈のために言ってくれたんだよな。\nありがとう、志保。", "zh": "所以志保也是为了可奈着想，才说那种话的吧。\n志保，谢谢你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_014_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_014_1048_033sih", "source_sha256": "b670f39f2d3abe6a28788d54c7fb4bab395110e538488fd9b145be4afae680ed", "ja": "…………。\nそういうわけじゃないですけど。", "zh": "…………\n不是那样的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_014_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_014_1049_p", "source_sha256": "b05cfe4e6dbb92fa1d5b42eade38b54024e0beaa09c104b5b7d55a50d3ba1cd1", "ja": "おせっかいついでに、今から一緒に可奈を探しに\n行かないか？　俺は、志保にも感じて欲しいんだ。", "zh": "既然你都插手管了，接下来要不要一起去找可奈？\n我想让志保也感受一下。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_014_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_014_1050_p", "source_sha256": "a3bb3a02a7681bccf023e5d9d6d3889739a30b68868a59330e5ee2105b973adb", "ja": "ジュリアが好きだっていう可奈の歌の魅力。\nきっと参考になると思う。", "zh": "可奈的歌声中，茱莉亚喜欢的那股魅力。\n我想那一定值得你参考。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_014_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_014_1051_033sih", "source_sha256": "701a2b85e503291bd7b1f0ae18e6ec4dd2e8120a996d46417c7edbf5c766b8cd", "ja": "{$P$}さんがそういうなら……。\nわかりました。", "zh": "既然{$P$}先生都这么说了……\n我知道了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_014_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_014_1053_050jul", "source_sha256": "a5d616a85f10f8fafa34c6be48d312461f2f249152f7af915b20abe49ab3a268", "ja": "っと、見つけた！\n可奈、こんなところにいたのか。", "zh": "啊，找到了！\n可奈，原来你在这啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_014_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_014_1054_036kan", "source_sha256": "fb9db4dd186ba5ebb63967b82df07fb8b97dcc7a86290bb30525a111efa606ff", "ja": "ジュリアさん……？", "zh": "茱莉亚……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_014_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_014_1055_050jul", "source_sha256": "b6f22ad4f7f030e8b4ff5aef6253f3355f64568406790f6df15e5d4d4fab7e3c", "ja": "{$P$}、こっちこっち！", "zh": "{$P$}，这边这边！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_014_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_014_1056_036kan", "source_sha256": "75577bd245037ee526a650c174cb6da8d2105f2486889cb9b73e9d0acc005415", "ja": "{$P$}さんも、志保ちゃんも……。", "zh": "{$P$}先生和志保也……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_014_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_014_1058_p", "source_sha256": "ecd83c78e341c8be3d4a40b2bc61f186d9dfaebdb3a06e4aef2202023eb1c51f", "ja": "可奈、大丈夫か？", "zh": "可奈，你还好吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_014_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_014_1059_036kan", "source_sha256": "18ac53b2934d4ebc7b762e96e1e43bf3bf8525f169637e83022cbbb9bee1fe6f", "ja": "？　あ、はい！\n休憩したから、もう疲れてませんっ！", "zh": "嗯？啊，很好！\n休息完已经不会累了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_014_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_014_1060_050jul", "source_sha256": "3ff3ba8656fb94ae969f55ffcc799529d0746ad84ae268610894cd26819fcf65", "ja": "は？　疲れって……？", "zh": "啊？累是指……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_014_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_014_1061_036kan", "source_sha256": "bf1d8f9e6705825f636e5f8e44344224b2ebd3271963caabc8eea30a0c0cd737", "ja": "あの……私、\nここで、ちょっと考えてたんですけど……。", "zh": "那个……\n我在这里，稍微想了一下……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_014_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_014_1062_036kan", "source_sha256": "7f7abc204ecb5160c5671ca20d5696006b434d86c54feed8d7ea7dddeca6fe16", "ja": "ダメなら、ダメじゃなくなるまで、\n練習すればいいんですよね？", "zh": "既然现在的功力不够，\n那我只要一直练到好不就行了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_014_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_014_1063_033sih", "source_sha256": "997257f0a452ca51a96d1d5cd79f326cdcbd9df9b6dd42fad0715de8da2072f3", "ja": "矢吹さん……？", "zh": "矢吹……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_014_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_014_1064_036kan", "source_sha256": "5d0b41749d250ea28fa37403883d85aed7cb199a84d8159d1112f10f9bc82d59", "ja": "千早さんと同じくらい……ううん、\nとにかく、できるまでいっぱい練習すれば……。", "zh": "练到跟千早一样……啊不，\n总之只要多多练习，直到能唱得好……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_014_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_014_1065_036kan", "source_sha256": "3eb12b01dc68815cd4ce7b7434c69ede92bfa8a648f1b3408f8d81a0ef27740a", "ja": "きっと、みんながびっくりして、わぁ～！っていう\nくらい、歌えるようになりますよね、きっと♪", "zh": "我想我的歌声一定能进步到\n让大家吃惊地喊出「哇～！」一声的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_014_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_014_1066", "source_sha256": "8b95de8eb5be7806d9a8b2c594ace198e0243c608fc90277538fc72ef3a6a374", "ja": "そうだな！", "zh": "说得对！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_014_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_014_2000_p", "source_sha256": "c826fc184771ffec0641d203a51daeabd54fc4bce3d1586d70dc88b2d0769c48", "ja": "ああ、そうだな！\n可奈はとにかく、歌が大好きなんだよな？", "zh": "嗯，说得对！\n可奈就是爱唱歌爱得不得了对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_014_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_014_2001_036kan", "source_sha256": "8b3ef5d52c82062d2c5cd4214ee7487c9721500e5122abab40a07f6f2ee21a42", "ja": "はいっ、大好きです！\nだから、ちゃんと歌えるまで～、いっぱい歌いま～す♪", "zh": "嗯，可奈最喜欢唱歌了！\n所以在练好歌喉以前～可奈要一直唱下去～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_014_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_014_2002_050jul", "source_sha256": "ab453958e234e01c85141d49d53927c03568c314b9dc16b3d089688d6203f3d9", "ja": "ぷっ……あはははっ！　さすがだよ、可奈。\n心配することなかったみたいだな。", "zh": "噗……啊哈哈哈！可奈，真有你的。\n看来是完全不用担心你呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_014_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_014_2003_036kan", "source_sha256": "d73d91261c46409fec33b6d759e41b7ffe74f2d1030ab7e72206af27b777d6b4", "ja": "あっ、志保ちゃん、さっきはありがとね！\nアドバイス、とっても参考になったよ！", "zh": "啊，志保，刚才谢谢你了！\n你的建议帮了我很多呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_014_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_014_2004_033sih", "source_sha256": "0efa8ad47180eca14b1ce1f7f0b825f8b004491432d460ec34f7e72412a8a2a8", "ja": "そ、そう……。", "zh": "是、是喔……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_014_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_014_2005_036kan", "source_sha256": "3cb4458cf8868d62e490dd7d1cdbd514f983e268dc7cc862ada164b3b8b88271", "ja": "だから、ほかにも何かあったら、また教えてね。\nいつでもいいから！", "zh": "所以要是还有其他想法，要再跟我说喔。\n我随时都接受指教！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_014_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_014_2006_033sih", "source_sha256": "b3377fbd4aa2a2a9e588275d21855b43a2bbd61ec8b2797aa01d98c5308042ad", "ja": "え、ええ、わかったわ……。", "zh": "呃，好，我知道了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_014_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_014_2008_033sih", "source_sha256": "5bf45b774a5bfae59388068cd063a3ab4ed4d58fa9afa017f992cd659d2c10ad", "ja": "お腹から声を出すイメージで歌うと、\n音程が取りやすくなると思う。", "zh": "想像自己用腹部发声的方式去唱歌，\n应该会比较容易抓到音准。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_014_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_014_2009_036kan", "source_sha256": "c6b14b880d4d670102662170de18ef6ee88c0a40338442fe84b3185a34cb792d", "ja": "本当！？　ありがとう、志保ちゃん！\n今度、試してみるね！", "zh": "真的吗！？谢谢你，志保！\n我下次试试看！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
